+/* PASS 7 (charter row 3; INTAKE row 11) — G3 AT THE COARSE RAIL. Pass 6's arm A put Deal −9.81 px
+   under the fade on WebKit at 1280×800 coarse (+7.14 chromium): the card's `overflow-y: auto` made
+   `overflow-x` auto too, the hover notes overhang its box by 64 px, and WebKit's classic 17 px
+   sideways bar lifted the fade. The card takes no sideways range now. The row reads G3 at both rail
+   cells in both engines; its plants are G3's own (the deal row pushed down) and the pass-6 shape (the
+   sideways range given back), which reds where the harness paints a classic bar (WebKit). */
+for (const vp of [
+  { width: 1280, height: 800 },
